{"version":2,"surah":82,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"82:1","arabic":" إِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ ٱنفَطَرَتْ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"When the sky breaks apart","id":"Apabila langit terbelah,","latinEn":"Itha assamao infatarat","latinId":"Iżas-samā'unfaṭarat.","words":[{"a":"إِذَا","en":"When","id":"When","t":"idhā"},{"a":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","en":"the sky","id":"the sky","t":"l-samāu"},{"a":"ٱنفَطَرَتْ","en":"(is) cleft asunder","id":"(is) cleft asunder","t":"infaṭarat"}]},{"n":2,"key":"82:2","arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْكَوَاكِبُ ٱنتَثَرَتْ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"And when the stars fall, scattering,","id":"dan apabila bintang-bintang jatuh berserakan,","latinEn":"Wa-itha alkawakibu intatharat","latinId":"Wa iżal-kawākibuntaṡarat.","words":[{"a":"وَإِذَا","en":"And when","id":"And when","t":"wa-idhā"},{"a":"ٱلْكَوَاكِبُ","en":"the stars","id":"the stars","t":"l-kawākibu"},{"a":"ٱنتَثَرَتْ","en":"scatter","id":"scatter","t":"intatharat"}]},{"n":3,"key":"82:3","arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْبِحَارُ فُجِّرَتْ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"And when the seas are erupted","id":"dan apabila lautan dijadikan meluap,","latinEn":"Wa-itha albiharu fujjirat","latinId":"Wa iżal-biḥāru fujjirat.","words":[{"a":"وَإِذَا","en":"And when","id":"And when","t":"wa-idhā"},{"a":"ٱلْبِحَارُ","en":"the seas","id":"the seas","t":"l-biḥāru"},{"a":"فُجِّرَتْ","en":"are made to gush forth","id":"are made to gush forth","t":"fujjirat"}]},{"n":4,"key":"82:4","arabic":"وَإِذَا ٱلْقُبُورُ بُعْثِرَتْ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"And when the [contents of] graves are scattered [i.e., exposed],","id":"dan apabila kuburan-kuburan dibongkar,","latinEn":"Wa-itha alqubooru buAAthirat","latinId":"Wa iżal-qubūru bu‘ṡirat.","words":[{"a":"وَإِذَا","en":"And when","id":"And when","t":"wa-idhā"},{"a":"ٱلْقُبُورُ","en":"the graves","id":"the graves","t":"l-qubūru"},{"a":"بُعْثِرَتْ","en":"are overturned","id":"are overturned","t":"buʿ'thirat"}]},{"n":5,"key":"82:5","arabic":"عَلِمَتْ نَفْسٌ مَّا قَدَّمَتْ وَأَخَّرَتْ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"A soul will [then] know what it has put forth and kept back.","id":"(maka) setiap jiwa akan mengetahui apa yang telah dikerjakan dan yang dilalaikan(nya).","latinEn":"AAalimat nafsun ma qaddamatwaakhkharat","latinId":"‘Alimat nafsum mā qaddamat wa akhkharat.","words":[{"a":"عَلِمَتْ","en":"Will know","id":"Will know","t":"ʿalimat"},{"a":"نَفْسٌۭ","en":"a soul","id":"a soul","t":"nafsun"},{"a":"مَّا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"قَدَّمَتْ","en":"it has sent forth","id":"it has sent forth","t":"qaddamat"},{"a":"وَأَخَّرَتْ","en":"and left behind","id":"and left behind","t":"wa-akharat"}]},{"n":6,"key":"82:6","arabic":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا غَرَّكَ بِرَبِّكَ ٱلْكَرِيمِ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous,","id":"Wahai manusia! Apakah yang telah memperdayakan kamu (berbuat durhaka) terhadap Tuhanmu Yang Maha Pengasih.","latinEn":"Ya ayyuha al-insanu magharraka birabbika alkareem","latinId":"Yā ayyuhal-insānu mā garraka birabbikal-karīm(i).","words":[{"a":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en":"O","id":"O","t":"yāayyuhā"},{"a":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en":"man","id":"man","t":"l-insānu"},{"a":"مَا","en":"What","id":"What","t":"mā"},{"a":"غَرَّكَ","en":"has deceived you","id":"has deceived you","t":"gharraka"},{"a":"بِرَبِّكَ","en":"concerning your Lord","id":"concerning your Lord","t":"birabbika"},{"a":"ٱلْكَرِيمِ","en":"the Most Noble","id":"the Most Noble","t":"l-karīmi"}]},{"n":7,"key":"82:7","arabic":"ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَكَ فَسَوَّىٰكَ فَعَدَلَكَ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"Who created you, proportioned you, and balanced you?","id":"Yang telah menciptakanmu lalu menyempurnakan kejadianmu dan menjadikan (susunan tubuh)mu seimbang,","latinEn":"Allathee khalaqaka fasawwakafaAAadalak","latinId":"Allażī khalaqaka fa sawwāka fa ‘adalak(a).","words":[{"a":"ٱلَّذِى","en":"Who","id":"Who","t":"alladhī"},{"a":"خَلَقَكَ","en":"created you","id":"created you","t":"khalaqaka"},{"a":"فَسَوَّىٰكَ","en":"then fashioned you","id":"then fashioned you","t":"fasawwāka"},{"a":"فَعَدَلَكَ","en":"then balanced you","id":"then balanced you","t":"faʿadalaka"}]},{"n":8,"key":"82:8","arabic":"فِىٓ أَىِّ صُورَةٍ مَّا شَآءَ رَكَّبَكَ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"In whatever form He willed has He assembled you.","id":"dalam bentuk apa saja yang dikehendaki, Dia menyusun tubuhmu.","latinEn":"Fee ayyi sooratin ma shaarakkabak","latinId":"Fī ayyi ṣūratim mā syā'a rakkabak(a).","words":[{"a":"فِىٓ","en":"In","id":"In","t":"fī"},{"a":"أَىِّ","en":"whatever","id":"whatever","t":"ayyi"},{"a":"صُورَةٍۢ","en":"form","id":"form","t":"ṣūratin"},{"a":"مَّا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"شَآءَ","en":"He willed","id":"He willed","t":"shāa"},{"a":"رَكَّبَكَ","en":"He assembled you","id":"He assembled you","t":"rakkabaka"}]},{"n":9,"key":"82:9","arabic":"كَلَّا بَلْ تُكَذِّبُونَ بِٱلدِّينِ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"No! But you deny the Recompense.","id":"Sekali-kali jangan begitu! Bahkan kamu mendustakan hari pembalasan.","latinEn":"Kalla bal tukaththiboona biddeen","latinId":"Kallā bal tukażżibūna bid-dīn(i).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّا","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"kallā"},{"a":"بَلْ","en":"But","id":"But","t":"bal"},{"a":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","en":"you deny","id":"you deny","t":"tukadhibūna"},{"a":"بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"the Judgment","id":"the Judgment","t":"bil-dīni"}]},{"n":10,"key":"82:10","arabic":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيْكُمْ لَحَـٰفِظِينَ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"And indeed, [appointed] over you are keepers,","id":"Dan sesungguhnya bagi kamu ada (malaikat-malaikat) yang mengawasi (pekerjaanmu),","latinEn":"Wa-inna AAalaykum lahafitheen","latinId":"Wa inna ‘alaikum laḥāfiẓīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَإِنَّ","en":"And indeed","id":"And indeed","t":"wa-inna"},{"a":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en":"over you","id":"over you","t":"ʿalaykum"},{"a":"لَحَـٰفِظِينَ","en":"(are) surely guardians","id":"(are) surely guardians","t":"laḥāfiẓīna"}]},{"n":11,"key":"82:11","arabic":"كِرَامًا كَـٰتِبِينَ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"Noble and recording;","id":"yang mulia (di sisi Allah) dan yang mencatat (perbuatanmu),","latinEn":"Kiraman katibeen","latinId":"Kirāman kātibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"كِرَامًۭا","en":"Noble","id":"Noble","t":"kirāman"},{"a":"كَـٰتِبِينَ","en":"recording","id":"recording","t":"kātibīna"}]},{"n":12,"key":"82:12","arabic":"يَعْلَمُونَ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"They know whatever you do.","id":"mereka mengetahui apa yang kamu kerjakan.","latinEn":"YaAAlamoona ma tafAAaloon","latinId":"Ya‘lamūna mā taf‘alūn(a).","words":[{"a":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en":"They know","id":"They know","t":"yaʿlamūna"},{"a":"مَا","en":"whatever","id":"whatever","t":"mā"},{"a":"تَفْعَلُونَ","en":"you do","id":"you do","t":"tafʿalūna"}]},{"n":13,"key":"82:13","arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْأَبْرَارَ لَفِى نَعِيمٍ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure,","id":"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang berbakti benar-benar berada dalam (surga yang penuh) kenikmatan,","latinEn":"Inna al-abrara lafee naAAeem","latinId":"Innal-abrāra lafī na‘īm(in).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"ٱلْأَبْرَارَ","en":"the righteous","id":"the righteous","t":"l-abrāra"},{"a":"لَفِى","en":"(will be) surely in","id":"(will be) surely in","t":"lafī"},{"a":"نَعِيمٍۢ","en":"bliss","id":"bliss","t":"naʿīmin"}]},{"n":14,"key":"82:14","arabic":"وَإِنَّ ٱلْفُجَّارَ لَفِى جَحِيمٍ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"And indeed, the wicked will be in Hellfire.","id":"dan sesungguhnya orang-orang yang durhaka benar-benar berada dalam neraka.","latinEn":"Wa-inna alfujjara lafee jaheem","latinId":"Wa innal-fujjāra lafī jaḥīm(in).","words":[{"a":"وَإِنَّ","en":"And indeed","id":"And indeed","t":"wa-inna"},{"a":"ٱلْفُجَّارَ","en":"the wicked","id":"the wicked","t":"l-fujāra"},{"a":"لَفِى","en":"(will be) surely in","id":"(will be) surely in","t":"lafī"},{"a":"جَحِيمٍۢ","en":"Hellfire","id":"Hellfire","t":"jaḥīmin"}]},{"n":15,"key":"82:15","arabic":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ","page":587,"juz":30,"en":"They will [enter to] burn therei